  "bot_instructions": {
    "step1": "Receive pincode from farmer.",
    "step2": "Call a pincode-to-district API (e.g., postalpincode.in or India Post API) to get district name.",
    "step3": "Normalize district name to match keys in district_to_dam_index (handle case, alternate spellings).",
    "step4": "Look up district in district_to_dam_index to get list of dam IDs.",
    "step5": "Fetch dam details from dams array using matched dam IDs.",
    "step6": "If multiple dams found, ask farmer about their taluk/village or crop type to narrow down.",
    "step7": "Present relevant dam info: name, canal system, crop seasons, release schedule, water authority contact.",
    "step8": "Optionally check live storage data from Tamil Nadu PWD portal: https://www.tawdeva.com or https://www.tnpwd.gov.in",
    "fallback": "If district not found in index, inform farmer that their area may depend on local tanks or minor irrigation. Advise contacting the local PWD office.",
    "language_note": "Respond in Tamil if farmer uses Tamil. Key Tamil terms: அணை (dam), கால்வாய் (canal), நீர்பாசனம் (irrigation), நீர் வெளியீடு (water release)."
  },

